<!--
	GENERATED by _src/make_osd.py (sign without buttons). Was: Seek bar (M3, Builder D). Mockup: docs/skin.sixdegrees/mockups/Seek.dc.html.
	Minimal bar over the playing picture: title + "ENDS 22:58 · 21:47", 3px track with buffer,
	played part, chapter ticks, playhead, a time bubble at the playhead, start/total times, and a
	top-right "+30s SKIP" tab while skipping.

	Id contract (Estuary Omega DialogSeekBar.xml / GUIDialogSeekBar.cpp): 401 = progress slider Kodi
	selects to the seek target (POPUP_SEEK_PROGRESS); 402/403 are PVR only (PVR unused, omitted).
	Window visibility conditions copied from Estuary Omega. The content steps aside while the OSD,
	the fullscreen info or a playback dialog is up (they draw their own progress): OSD_SeekBarHidden.
-->
